Bot: RVR & JC College offers a wide range of facilities to support student life and learning. The Central Library holds 92,496 volumes, 25,793 titles, 144 print journals, and e-journals via DelNet, with NPTEL video lectures for digital learning. Department-specific laboratories, including those for CSE, ECE, Mechanical, and more, provide hands-on training. Hostels accommodate 1250 boys (NES Mens Hostel, adjacent to campus) and 650 girls (NES Womens Hostel, Guntur city), with amenities like Wi-Fi, gym, and vegetarian meals. The canteen offers diverse South and North Indian dishes. Sports facilities include cricket, badminton, table tennis, and a gym. Campus-wide Wi-Fi, computer centers, seminar halls, an auditorium, and a dispensary with free medicines ensure a holistic environment. Transportation is available, with bus services for girls’ hostel residents (INR 18,000 annually, 2024-25). For more details, contact the college at 0863-2288201 or info@rvrjc.ac.in. Want details on specific facilities like the library or sports? \U0001f3eb Want details on specific facilities like the library or sports?
